  ⚠ jsx-a11y(svg-has-title): SVG elements must have an accessible name.
   ╭─[svg_has_title.tsx:1:2]
 1 │ <Icon />
   ·  ────
   ╰────
  help: Add a non-empty `title` as the first child, or use `role="img"` with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. Mark decorative SVGs with `aria-hidden="true"`.

